  "description": "CR 700.4 / 111.2 / 603.4 / 701.27a / 205.1b / 702.10b: Voldaren Bloodcaster makes Blood for each nontoken creature of yours that dies, transforms when you create a fifth Blood, and Bloodbat Summoner makes a fresh Blood a hasty 2/2 black flying Bat for good",
